---
layout: base.njk
title: Team
permalink: /team/
description: "The people behind DC Social Collective."
---
<div class="wrap page-head">
  <h1>The team</h1>
  <p class="lede">A founder, a director, and the ambassadors who make sure nobody stands alone at the wall.</p>
</div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap team">
  {%- for m in team %}
    <article>
      <img src="{{ m.photo }}" alt="{{ m.name }}" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy">
      <h2>{{ m.name }}</h2>
      <p class="role">{{ m.role }}</p>
      <p>{{ m.bio }}</p>
    </article>
  {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="band paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Want to be part of it?</h2>
    <p class="lede">We take on brand ambassadors and volunteers a few times a year.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="/get-involved/">Get involved</a>
  </div>
</section>
